We synthesized a single crystalline porphyrinic titanium MOF, in which the Ti-oxo clusters and porphyrinic ligands are combined into an inherent dye-sensitized photoactive system. PCN-22 represents an important step towards mimicking dye sensitized $\mathrm{TiO}_{2}$ in MOFs.
